<tr><td>Underlayment</td><td>Required beneath new roofing; quantity should match the roof area.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Drip edge, starter course, ridge cap</td><td>Separate components from field shingles and often left off.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Flashing, pipe jacks, vents</td><td>Step, counter, and valley flashing plus vents and boots damaged by hail or wind.</td></tr>
